1
00:00:00,054 --> 00:00:01,724
- Yes, obviously.
- All right.

2
00:00:01,889 --> 00:00:05,729
(Sheldon:)Well, given that missing you
is predicated on you leaving...

3
00:00:05,893 --> 00:00:09,233
(Sheldon:)...logic dictates you must leave.

4
00:00:10,148 --> 00:00:13,278
(Leonard:)Yes, okay, but I'm gonna be gone
for three months.

5
00:00:13,443 --> 00:00:16,613
(Leonard:)What if she doesn't miss me that long
and she meets someone else?

6
00:00:17,405 --> 00:00:20,655
(Sheldon:)She does have a short attention span.

7
00:00:20,825 --> 00:00:23,665
- So I can't go.
- Leonard, you may be right.

8
00:00:23,828 --> 00:00:26,458
(Sheldon:)It appears that Penny secretly
wants you in her life...

9
00:00:26,622 --> 00:00:29,252
(Sheldon:)...in a very intimate
and carnal fashion.

10
00:00:30,293 --> 00:00:33,133
- You really think so?
- Of course not.

11
00:00:35,423 --> 00:00:37,093
(Sheldon:)Even in my sleep-deprived state...

12
00:00:37,258 --> 00:00:40,848
(Sheldon:)...I've managed to pull off
another one of my classic pranks.

13
00:00:41,471 --> 00:00:43,181
Buzzinga.

14
00:00:50,772 --> 00:00:54,112
- Oh, Leonard, what time is it?
- Seven a.m. I'm sorry it's early.

15
00:00:54,275 --> 00:00:56,695
(Leonard:)But we're leaving soon
and I needed to talk to you.

16
00:00:56,861 --> 00:00:58,281
(Leonard(making a change):)Okay.

